<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Join Our Telegram Community</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Join our Telegram community for updates and announcements.">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 24px;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #eef4ff, #f8fbff);
      color: #172033;
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 460px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 34px 28px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(30, 60, 100, 0.12);
    }

    .icon {
      width: 74px;
      height: 74px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #229ed9;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .intro {
      color: #667085;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .points {
      text-align: left;
      margin: 0 0 26px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .points li {
      margin: 11px 0;
      color: #344054;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .points li::before {
      content: "✓";
      display: inline-grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 22px;
      height: 22px;
      margin-right: 9px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e7f6ff;
      color: #229ed9;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: #229ed9;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 700;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      opacity: 0.92;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #98a2b3;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="card">

    <div class="icon">✈</div>

    <h1>Join Our Telegram Community</h1>

    <p class="intro">
      Join our Telegram community to receive updates,
     
